From 90d331a0d9ef08289f214bf6c57cf7a7c6d2ceb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 06:50:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] clarify: persist why a batch clarify was cancelled
 (interrupted/taken_over/shutdown/client_empty) in both registries

The stored tool result said only outcome=cancelled for a Stop, a session takeover, a backend exit
and an empty client response, so an incident (desktop-d39268b86c) could not be attributed without
transcript forensics. settle_batch now takes a reason label that both registries pass and the clarify
tool result carries; a takeover/close/backend-exit interrupt no longer reads as a plain Stop.
Reason is a label only, no answer content. t_01a1cdc7df9e82dd
